      "recommendation": "optional",
      "default": true,
      "dependencies": [
        "decky"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "common/fingerprint/bridge/main.py",
        "common/fingerprint/runtime-profile/profile.json",
        "common/fingerprint/providers/identity.py",
        "common/fingerprint/providers/bf63112/source.toon",
        "common/fingerprint/providers/fte3600/source.toon",
        "brands/onexplayer/x2-mini/current/fingerprint/69-boiler-x2-fingerprint.rules",
        "common/fingerprint/kde/install-kde-pam.py",
        "common/fingerprint/kde/README.md"
      ],
      "status": "external_runtime_required",
      "notes": "Generic bridge and BF63112/FTE3600 provider source references; the target sensor is matched by its SPI ACPI HID, not by model name. FTE3600 on this model is enrolled, verified and unlocks the Plasma lock screen on tested hardware; BF63112 remains a source reference and is not installable here. Boot-time installation and maintenance payloads for the FTE3600 runtime are still not implemented in the installer. Preserve user disable and Steam PIN fallback. Source: FlightDan/FingerprintUnlock-SteamOS@fde8fa62bbad0318a9a8be88cc77bb4c3b4f919e; public lock: common/fingerprint/public-bridge-lock.json. Do not guess reset GPIO wiring."
